= April 2020 — The postal election

PiS prepares an improvised all-postal vote for May. Municipalities, the
electoral commission and Jarosław Gowin's faction all question whether a lawful
election can occur. We must defend the ballot without making our own candidate
disappear from it.

- @postal_front
- @postal_gowin
- @postal_boycott
- @postal_compete

@postal_front
title: Build one opposition legal and municipal front
subtitle: Requires both trust and institutional compatibility with KO.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 40 and ko_coalition_openness >= 42
unavailable-subtitle: KO will not yet put its mayors under a common command.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Democratic legal front"; ko_relation += 7; judicial_legitimacy += 6; constitutional_restraint += 5; public_trust += 4; president_relation -= 4; media_capacity += 2; news_headline = "Mayors and opposition parties refuse an unlawful improvisation"

We join our lawyers to opposition mayors, preserve the evidence and demand a
lawful later vote. KO has to share the platform, and our candidate remains in
view rather than becoming a footnote to its mayors.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_gowin
title: Help Gowin's revolt postpone the vote
subtitle: Effective but dependent on a conservative government dissenter.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Gowin postponement bargain"; pis_relation += 4; ko_relation -= 2; public_trust += 3; party_unity -= 2; barons_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent += 4; news_headline = "A crack inside the United Right stops the May vote"

We help Gowin deny PiS its majority. The vote is postponed through arithmetic,
not a clean constitutional settlement, and the conservative dissenter leaves
the room with ownership of the result.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_boycott
title: Announce an unconditional boycott
subtitle: Clear illegitimacy claim; abandons the electoral field.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Boycott"; progressive_credibility += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; left_poll -= 0.5; media_capacity -= 2; ko_relation -= 3; news_headline = "The Left refuses the postal ballot"

Our refusal is clear enough for every voter to repeat. It is also difficult to
reverse when the date and procedure change and our candidate needs the field
we abandoned.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_compete
title: Campaign as if the vote will occur
subtitle: Media capacity determines whether defiance looks prepared.
on-arrival: {!
Q.postal_election_stance = "Compete and litigate";
if (Q.media_capacity >= 25) {
    Q.left_poll += 0.6;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.presidential_campaign_bonus = (Q.presidential_campaign_bonus || 0) + 0.5;
