= November 2020 — After the first marches

Organisers face threats, police pressure, exhaustion and internal arguments
over tactics. Some protests enter churches. The movement's demands expand
beyond one judgment, while party leaders want a message that fits a ballot.

- @strike_defence
- @strike_programme
- @strike_condemn
- @strike_order

@strike_defence
title: Build an independent legal-defence and safety network
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Durable capacity, little immediate polling.
