subtitle: A harder conservative turn can organise Social Patriots and drive the movement Left toward rupture.
on-arrival: police_trust += 4; president_relation += 6; psl_relation += 5; left_cultural_position += 7; left_right_score += 6; social_patriot_support += 10; barons_dissent -= 6; feminist_trust -= 16; progressive_credibility -= 9; progressives_dissent += 15; spring_dissent += 12; razem_dissent += 12; labor_dissent += 5; party_unity -= 6; womens_strike_followup = "Order-first response"; news_headline = "Lewica backs an order-first response to the Women's Strike"

The line is no longer tactical distance from particular protests. It offers a
home to culturally conservative welfare voters and tells movement organisers
that the common party may no longer be theirs.

- @poland_foreign_events.us_election_2020: Follow the 3 November result

